先生，如淳于髡、慎到、環淵、接子、田駢、騶奭之徒，各著書言治亂之事，以干世主，豈可勝道哉！"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun:p008","quote":"慎到，趙人。田駢、接子，齊人。環淵，楚人。皆學黃老道德之術，因發明序其指意。故慎到著十二論，環淵著上下篇，而田駢、接子皆有所論焉。"}]}],"equivalence_decisions":[{"id":"eq-shiji074-huan","person_ids":["cbr-p002798","cbr-p004308"],"canonical_person_id":"cbr-p002798","scope":"cross_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-046-tian","c-shiji-074-mengxun"],"status":"contextual_provisional","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-046-tian","source_id":"s-shiji-046-tian","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-046-tian:p039","quote":"宣王喜文學游説之士，自如騶衍、淳于髡、田駢、接子、愼到、環淵之徒七十六人，皆賜列第，爲上大夫，不治而議論。是以齊稷下學士復盛，且數百千人。","mention_ids":["c-shiji-046-tian:m039-0028"]},{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun","source_id":"s-shiji-074-mengxun","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun:p006","quote":"自騶衍與齊之稷下先生，如淳于髡、慎到、環淵、接子、田駢、騶奭之徒，各著書言治亂之事，以干世主，豈可勝道哉！","mention_ids":["c-shiji-074-mengxun:m006-0019"]}],"rationale":"兩篇環淵同列稷下騶衍、淳于髡、田駢、接子與慎到，姓名及特定同列人物語境相配。 原字、原文與已發ID保留，同書篇章不視為獨立見證；同指不確證全部紀年、任職或敘事，也不作全域同名批量合併。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null}],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:p039","text":"宣王喜文學游説之士，自如騶衍、淳于髡、田駢、接子、愼到、環淵之徒七十六人，皆賜列第，爲上大夫，不治而議論。是以齊稷下學士復盛，且數百千人。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m039-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"宣王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002768","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m039-0012","start":12,"end":14,"surface":"騶衍","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002794","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m039-0015","start":15,"end":18,"surface":"淳于髡","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002766","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m039-0019","start":19,"end":21,"surface":"田駢","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002795","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m039-0022","start":22,"end":24,"surface":"接子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002796","status":"contextual_provisional"},